            "review_title": "Review at The Pizza Company",
            "review_text": "TanjungBaraDiver\nHanoi, Vietnam1974 contributions\n0\nBest deep dish pizza I have had in a long time\nDec 2022\nPizza Hut used to have deep dish pizzas. I don't know if they still have them, nor if there is still a Pizza Hut, but in any case, I used to love them but haven't had one in a long time. This place was on my way home so I grabbed a Deep Dish Meat Deluxe. It was awesome. I ate half but it could have fed three. Very tasty, and cooked really well. Will be back. Service is pretty good too.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 10, 2022",
